            "type": "game",
            "name": "Lost Connection",
            "steam_appid": 685330,
            "required_age": 0,
            "is_free": false,
            "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/685330/extras/abf85e40ce6789e5b6b7d8335bdf5c55.avif?t=1541574944\" width=630 height=70 /></span><br>Lost Connection is an indie arcade with a storyline where you have to work hard! Let the laconic graphics do not deceive you, in fact, every wrong move threatens to lose, and then the level will have to start again. But procrastination is also not the best way out - our hero must move continuously, so as not to lose energy. Which path will you choose - the ideal timing or thoughtful gradual advancement? <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/685330/extras/9134f286064b48dea5806f2b37acd4fb.avif?t=1541574944\" width=630 height=70 /></span><br>The main hero is a rare luck - to hack the site of the terrorist organization IT-Vira. But such an invasion can not go unnoticed, and from the hunter he becomes a victim. What's next you can learn from the comics that are shown before each level of the game.<br><br>Your hero will have to go through game levels of varying difficulty in arcade mode, in the form of a file inside a virtual network. Simple, but bright 2D graphics will allow you to dive into this dynamic arcade platformer and dive into a fascinating default storyline, which reveal what is happening in the game between levels!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/685330/extras/ea5287b463fea7512e75825fd404f9f3.avif?t=1541574944\" width=630 height=70 /></span><br>- Exciting storyline;<br>- Convenient control;<br>- Hardcore gameplay;<br>- Elements of the puzzle;<br>- Choosing a difficulty level;<br>- Stylish graphics;",
            "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/685330/extras/abf85e40ce6789e5b6b7d8335bdf5c55.avif?t=1541574944\" width=630 height=70 /></span><br>Lost Connection is an indie arcade with a storyline where you have to work hard! Let the laconic graphics do not deceive you, in fact, every wrong move threatens to lose, and then the level will have to start again. But procrastination is also not the best way out - our hero must move continuously, so as not to lose energy. Which path will you choose - the ideal timing or thoughtful gradual advancement? <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/685330/extras/9134f286064b48dea5806f2b37acd4fb.avif?t=1541574944\" width=630 height=70 /></span><br>The main hero is a rare luck - to hack the site of the terrorist organization IT-Vira. But such an invasion can not go unnoticed, and from the hunter he becomes a victim. What's next you can learn from the comics that are shown before each level of the game.<br><br>Your hero will have to go through game levels of varying difficulty in arcade mode, in the form of a file inside a virtual network. Simple, but bright 2D graphics will allow you to dive into this dynamic arcade platformer and dive into a fascinating default storyline, which reveal what is happening in the game between levels!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/685330/extras/ea5287b463fea7512e75825fd404f9f3.avif?t=1541574944\" width=630 height=70 /></span><br>- Exciting storyline;<br>- Convenient control;<br>- Hardcore gameplay;<br>- Elements of the puzzle;<br>- Choosing a difficulty level;<br>- Stylish graphics;",
